{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/copy-git-repo-mirroring/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Yerin Blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"c4ae9ee0-8d32-5716-9da1-e27f8fd55fc4","excerpt":"1. Copy your Git Repository to another (git mirroring) Clone your repository Set the push location to your mirror Push to your mirror 2. git merge with commit…","html":"<h2>1. Copy your Git Repository to another (git mirroring)</h2>\n<h3>Clone your repository</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">git</span> clone <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--mirror</span> https://github.com/exampleuser/repository-to-mirror.git</code></pre></div>\n<h3>Set the push location to your mirror</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">cd</span> repository-to-mirror.git\n<span class=\"token function\">git</span> remote set-url origin https://github.com/exampleuser/mirrored.git</code></pre></div>\n<h3>Push to your mirror</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">git</span> push <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--mirror</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>2. git merge with commit log</h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">git</span> merge --no-ff <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>branch<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.atlassian.com/git/tutorials/using-branches/git-merge#:~:text=In%20the%20event%20that%20you,the%20%2D%2Dno%2Dff%20option.&#x26;text=This%20command%20merges%20the%20specified,a%20fast%2Dforward%20merge\">Git - git-merge Documentation</a>.)</p>\n<h2>3. Update feature branch with develop branch</h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">git:<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>develop<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> ✗ <span class=\"token function\">git</span> checkout feature-branch\ngit:<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>feature-branch<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> ✗ <span class=\"token function\">git</span> rebase develop</code></pre></div>\n<h2>4. Create a patch file from a commit</h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">git</span> format-patch <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-1</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>commit<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>Applying the patch</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">git</span> apply <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--stat</span> file.patch  <span class=\"token comment\"># show status of the patch</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">git</span> apply <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--check</span> file.patch <span class=\"token comment\"># check for error before applying</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">git</span> am <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> file.patch          <span class=\"token comment\"># apply the patch finally</span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Ref: <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/6658313/generate-a-git-patch-for-a-specific-commit\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/6658313/generate-a-git-patch-for-a-specific-commit</a></li>\n</ul>","timeToRead":1,"frontmatter":{"title":"(Updated) Git cheatsheet (Mirroring, Merge, Rebase, Patch)","date":"November 02, 2023","description":null,"tags":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/node-run-error/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Vite build error"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/vite-test-package-vitest/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"How to Test Vite + React application (Vitest)"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"c4ae9ee0-8d32-5716-9da1-e27f8fd55fc4","previousPostId":"8a3be59c-4b7b-5a00-97bc-495d0a76ccb3","nextPostId":"0351a350-56f5-50e2-a8b4-d070897837bb"}},"staticQueryHashes":["3351346743","3517523002","4021987012"]}